{"record":"parent_entry","position":{"parent_record":"c695da87-b586-57f2-ba67-c3342e744f6c:0000","subposition":null},"original_role":"tool","source":"tool_result","trust":"untrusted","provenance":null,"content":"{\"kind\":\"tool_result\",\"call_id\":\"call_01a16afca4bf70a1a4ba236a996780fa\",\"output\":\"{\\\"query\\\":\\\"FigCraft figcraft-cli download Linux headless\\\",\\\"results\\\":[{\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://figcraft.run/mcp\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"FigCraft MCP Server: Let AI Agents Design UI\\\",\\\"snippet\\\":\\\"Get `figcraft-cli`: on macOS it is the separate `figcraft-cli-0.6.0-macos-universal.zip` release download; the Linux .deb and .rpm install it as `/usr/bin/figcraft-cli`; the Windows installer and portable zip include `figcraft-cli.exe`. ... claude mcp add figcraft -- /path/to/figcraft-cli mcp ... drive the running app (start it with: figcraft --control 7979) ... claude mcp add figcraft-app -- /path/to/figcraft-cli mcp --attach 7979\\\",\\\"page_last_modified\\\":-1},{\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://figcraft.net/guides/figcraft-mcp-claude\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"FigCraft MCP: Let Claude Design Screens in FigCraft\\\",\\\"snippet\\\":\\\"Get figcraft-cli\\\\nThe MCP server is part of the desktop downloads, not the web editor. ... - **macOS:** download `figcraft-cli-<version>-macos-universal.zip` from the\\\\nFigCraft downloads and unzip it.\\\\n- **Linux AppImage:** the AppImage bundles the CLI — ... `FigCraft.AppImage cli mcp` works wherever `figcraft-cli mcp` appears below.\\\\n- **From source:** `cargo build --release -p figcraft-cli` and use\\\\n`target/release/figcraft-cli`.\\\\nUse the **absolute path** to the CLI in the steps below.\\\",\\\"page_last_modified\\\":1792108800},{\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://pasqualepillitteri.it/en/news/23599/figcraft-guide-free-figma-alternative-rust\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"FigCraft guide, the free Figma alternative written in Rust\\\",\\\"snippet\\\":\\\"In headless mode it runs without a window, with a document in memory; in attac